  "Innsbruck, 21.9.1415 – Linz, 19.8.1493; hijo del duque Ernesto de Austria (†1424); boda con Leonor de Portugal (1451–1452); elegido rey de romanos el 2.2.1440; coronado emperador en Roma en 1452.": "Innsbruck, 21 September 1415 – Linz, 19 August 1493; son of Duke Ernest of Austria (d. 1424); marriage to Eleanor of Portugal (1451–1452); elected King of the Romans on 2 February 1440; crowned emperor in Rome in 1452.",
